{
    "title": "BabyLight - Baby Night Light",
    "description": "BabyLight features:\r\n- 5 customizable colors \r\n- easy brightness settings\r\n- clock mode\r\n- timer mode\r\n- screen stays ON until time is out\r\n- smooth color cycle mode\r\n- settings are saved for next use\r\n\r\nThe app is suitable for babies and children under parental supervision: \r\n- do the setup and start the fullscreen mode to turn the phone into a night light\r\n- if the device is to stay close to the child, we recommend to put it into \"flight mode\" to avoid long exposure to radio waves during the night\r\n\r\nThe app is also suitable for parents, nonparents, grandparents, and all ;)\r\n\r\nRatings and comments are greatly appreciated! Please let us know how we can make it even better :)",
    "descriptionHTML": "BabyLight features:<br>- 5 customizable colors <br>- easy brightness settings<br>- clock mode<br>- timer mode<br>- screen stays ON until time is out<br>- smooth color cycle mode<br>- settings are saved for next use<br><br>The app is suitable for babies and children under parental supervision: <br>- do the setup and start the fullscreen mode to turn the phone into a night light<br>- if the device is to stay close to the child, we recommend to put it into &quot;flight mode&quot; to avoid long exposure to radio waves during the night<br><br>The app is also suitable for parents, nonparents, grandparents, and all ;)<br><br>Ratings and comments are greatly appreciated! Please let us know how we can make it even better :)",
